          <p>A regional retail group operating across the Gulf faced inventory discrepancies between its physical stores and e-commerce platform, with stock counts drifting by several percentage points daily. MEAICON implemented a secure omnichannel connectivity backbone linking point-of-sale terminals, warehouse management systems and the online storefront. Real-time inventory sync eliminated stockout penalties and enabled ship-from-store fulfilment, reducing delivery times and increasing customer satisfaction across both channels.</p>
