          <p>A North African home goods retailer wanted to leverage customer analytics to personalise in-store and online promotions. MEAICON integrated anonymised footfall sensors, loyalty programme data and e-commerce behaviour into a unified analytics platform running on secure, segmented infrastructure. The insights enabled targeted campaigns that increased average basket size and repeat purchase rates, while all data flows were secured and segmented in line with emerging national data protection regulations. The retailer also gained real-time dashboards that merchandising teams used to adjust store layouts and promotions dynamically based on traffic patterns.</p>
